   512	
   513	`terminal_metrics` lazily creates fresh dict/arrays; banks/margin preserve f64, episode_steps is i64-checked Python int, winner integer, econ arrays C-contiguous `[32]` int64. Return None before a terminal transition, after a nonterminal step, or for a selected explicit reset. Never expose mutable native record storage. Seed/snapshot consumers are rollback/seed tests, run provenance and Task 3.3; full terminal snapshots are not required here. Task 7.3 uses codec plus seeded replay.
