   749	Claude reviewed this brief and its 1.5 companion against contract v4, plan Task 1.4/C5/L2/L3/L6, Isaiah's `src/rl/vec_env.rs`, `python/owl/rl.py`, `python/owl/train/ppo.py` and `scripts/run_ppo.py`, and the vendored kernel. The draft was also checked against the implemented grammar (`kg/rebuild-grammar` at `7877c46`), the 1.3 brief (`kg/rebuild-observe` at `32e2cdd`, parent `4c48d38`), and the reference sources (`kg/reference-2026-09-29` at `65f0eac5`). Verdict: **approve with the edits below, applied in place.** Codex's unedited draft is commit `6ea11d2`.
